    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000041c', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005b', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000041b', N'incident', N'completed', N'completed', 100, N'[{"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Reading the incident and the application''s service catalogue"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Triage complete: priority P2, category batch, 2 service(s) to examine"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "context", "message": "Context ready: 1 runbook match(es), 1 dependency link(s) in the neighbourhood"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Querying telemetry for 2 service(s) over 154 minutes and a matching baseline"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Collected 5 evidence items; 3 with a medium or high signal"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "hypotheses", "message": "Three analysts (application, dependencies, infrastructure) are forming hypotheses in parallel"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Comparing the three hypotheses and writing the root cause analysis"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Root cause analysis written; mapping the blast radius"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Blast radius mapped: 1 direct, 0 indirect"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "communications", "message": "Drafting English and Japanese updates"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "completed", "message": "Investigation complete"}]', '2026-11-18 03:18:00.000000', '2026-11-18 05:52:00.000000', '2026-11-18 00:44:00.000000', '2026-11-18 03:18:00.000000', N'{"suggested_priority": "P2", "priority_rationale": "Customer-facing impact on a Policy Administration Mainframe (US) journey with a recent onset; priority follows the reported impact and urgency.", "incident_category": "batch", "candidate_service_names": ["premium-billing-batch"], "incident_summary": "Policy Administration Mainframe (US): nightly premium billing batch did not complete. Users and systems of Policy Administration Mainframe (US) are affected.", "key_symptoms": ["nightly premium billing batch did not complete"], "time_of_onset_hint": "Shortly before the incident was opened", "contains_instruction_like_text": false, "final_priority": "P2", "guardrail_priority": null, "mapped_servicenow_priority": "P2"}', N'The nightly premium billing run in Policy Administration Mainframe (US) stopped part-way because one input record is malformed. Statements for the billing cycle are delayed until the record is corrected and the job is restarted from the failed step.', N'The nightly premium billing batch for Policy Administration Mainframe (US) did not complete: job PBIL0400 abended in step STEP030 [E1], so downstream statements were not produced.', N'PBIL0400 abended with S0C7, a data exception, in program PBILCALC [E1]. This happens when the program does arithmetic on a field that is not valid packed decimal, most likely a malformed premium amount in the input data set.', N'Correct or skip the malformed input record, then restart the job from the failed step as the runbook describes.

**Step 1. Find the malformed record** (diagnose; low risk)

Identify the malformed packed-decimal premium amount in PBIL.INPUT.D1119 from the dump of step STEP030.

**Step 2. Correct the input record** (mitigate; medium risk)

Correct or remove the record in a copy of the input data set (data change, requires batch operations approval).

Check: Compare the copy with the original to see only that record changed.

Undo: Keep the original input data set untouched so the run can be repeated.

**Step 3. Restart the job from the failed step** (mitigate; medium risk)

Restart PBIL0400 from STEP030 with RESTART=STEP030 on the job card, through the batch scheduler.

Check: PBIL0400 ends with condition code 0000 and downstream statements are produced.

Undo: Nothing to undo: a failed run can be repeated from the same step.', N'["Which upstream extract produced the malformed premium amount?", "Is it safe to skip the record or must it be corrected first?"]', N'{"schema_version": 2, "overview_markdown": "Correct or skip the malformed input record, then restart the job from the failed step as the runbook describes.", "step_references": [{"perspective": "application", "step_id": "application-1"}, {"perspective": "application", "step_id": "application-2"}, {"perspective": "application", "step_id": "application-3"}]}', 0.85, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000042e', N'{"nodes": [{"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005f", "serviceName": "premium-billing-batch", "serviceType": "batch_job_stream", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005e", "serviceName": "cics-policy-online", "serviceType": "mainframe_subsystem", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "investigated"}], "edges": [{"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005f", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005e", "kind": "reads_from"}], "impactedSlos": [{"sloId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002a8", "sliId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002a5", "applicationId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005b", "applicationName": "Policy Administration Mainframe (US)", "serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005f", "serviceName": "premium-billing-batch", "sliName": "premium-billing-batch: Batch job success", "sliKind": "run_success", "isHeadline": false, "isApproximate": false, "targetPercentage": 99.5, "rollingWindowDays": 30, "compliancePercentage": 99.757, "errorBudgetRemainingPercentage": 51.4, "errorBudgetRemainingMinutes": 111.0, "errorBudgetTotalMinutes": 216.0, "burnRateOneHour": 0.0, "burnRateSixHours": 0.0, "status": "healthy", "sparkline": [100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 99.653, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 99.653, 100.0, 100.0, 93.75, 100.0, 100.0]}], "stakeholders": [{"displayName": "Kai Admin", "role": "sre", "preferredLanguageCode": "en"}], "narrativeMarkdown": "premium-billing-batch is the primary point of failure (premium-billing-batch).", "userImpactSummary": "Users of Policy Administration Mainframe (US) experience errors or delays in the affected journey."}', N'[{"referenceCode": "K1", "title": "Application topology", "sourceKind": "topology", "knowledgeDocumentId": null}]', N'correct', NULL, N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', NULL, N'cause_identified', N'cause_identified', NULL, N'PBIL0400 abended with S0C7, a data exception, in program PBILCALC [E1].', N'Best supported by direct evidence and timing: PBIL0400 abended S0C7 on a malformed packed-decimal premium amount.', 15636, 2894, N'["offline-factory"]', N'system:seed', '2026-11-18 04:19:00.000000', '2026-11-18 04:22:00.000000', '2026-11-18 04:19:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:seed', NULL);
