    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002de', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002b1', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002b2', N'initial_update', N'stakeholders', N'en', N'[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Initial update', N'We are aware of an issue affecting Claims Processing (JP) (claims-document-renderer, claims-apim). Parts of Claims Processing (JP) intermittently fail because a service keeps running out of memory and restarting. Users see occasional errors when documents are rendered. A temporary memory increase and restart stabilise it; the underlying memory leak needs a code fix.

- **Status:** investigating
