aseline [E2]. 2. A configuration change preceded onset by minutes [E9]. 3. claims-sql session usage rose in step with the errors [E1]. The change explains both the new pattern and the timing.", "confidence_score": 0.86, "assessment": "supported", "assessment_reason_markdown": "Direct evidence that changed against the baseline fits the onset [E2] [E9] [E1].", "supporting_evidence_codes": ["E2", "E9", "E1"], "contradicting_evidence_codes": [], "proposed_fix": {"summary": "Restore the previous batch import concurrency, restart the service to release saturated connections, then cap parallelism below the pool size.", "steps": [{"title": "Restore the previous batch import concurrency", "purpose": "mitigate", "action": {"action_kind": "configuration_change", "description": "Set BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM back to 4 on claims-api (it is 16 now).", "command": null, "configuration_change": {"target_kind": "kubernetes_environment_variable", "service_name": "claims-api", "setting_name": {"name": "setting", "value_kind": "configuration_key", "value": "BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM", "value_source": "evidence", "source_code": "E9"}, "before_value": {"name": "before", "value_kind": "configuration_value", "value": "16", "value_source": "evidence", "source_code": "E9"}, "after_value": {"name": "after", "value_kind": "configuration_value", "value": "4", "value_source": "evidence", "source_code": "E9"}, "file_path": null}, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "check": {"action_kind": "rerun_evidence_query", "description": "Failed requests return to baseline.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": "E6", "expected_result": "No failures within 10 minutes."}, "revert": null, "risk_level": "medium", "assumptions": []}, {"title": "Restart the service", "purpose": "mitigate", "action": {"action_kind": "command", "description": "Restart claims-api so new pods pick up the corrected configuration.", "command": {"tool": "kubectl", "dialect": "any", "template": "kubectl rollout restart deployment/{{deployment}} -n {{namespace}}", "parameters": [{"name": "deployment", "value_kind": "kubernetes_name", "value": "claims-api", "value_source": "service_catalogue", "source_code": null}, {"name": "namespace", "value_kind": "kubernetes_namespace", "value": "claims", "value_source": "service_catalogue", "source_code": null}]}, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "check": {"action_kind": "rerun_evidence_query", "description": "Failed requests return to baseline.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": "E6", "expected_result": "No failures within 10 minutes."}, "revert": {"action_kind": "manual_action", "description": "Nothing to undo: new instances start from the corrected configuration.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "risk_level": "medium", "assumptions": []}, {"title": "Confirm SQL sessions are falling back", "purpose": "diagnose", "action": {"action_kind": "command", "description": "Confirm SQL sessions are falling back below 60 percent.", "command": {"tool": "az", "dialect": "any", "template": "az monitor metrics list --resource {{resource_id}} --metric sessions_percent --interval PT5M --aggregation Maximum", "parameters": [{"name": "resource_id", "value_kind": "azure_resource_id", "value": "/subscriptions/8d1c3f2a-4b6e-4c1d-9a7f-21530c1a0001/resourceGroups/RG_21530_CLMJP_PRD01/providers/Microsoft.Sql/servers/databases/claims-sql", "value_source": "service_catalogue", "source_code": null}]}, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": "The maximum of sessions_percent stays below 60."}, "check": null, "revert": null, "risk_level": "low", "assumptions": []}, {"title": "Cap parallelism below the pool size", "purpose": "durable_fix", "action": {"action_kind": "manual_action", "description": "Size the connection pool for peak parallelism and reject configuration where parallelism exceeds the pool.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "check": {"action_kind": "manual_action", "description": "Confirm the service refuses to start when parallelism exceeds the pool.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "revert": null, "risk_level": "low", "assumptions": []}], "code_changes": [{"repository_name": "claims-api", "file_path": "file not identified (batch import and connection pool configuration of claims-api)", "change_description": "Cap batch import parallelism at the connection pool size and fail fast at startup when the configuration exceeds it.", "before_snippet": "batch.import.parallelism: 16\nhikari.maximumPoolSize: 10", "after_snippet": "batch.import.parallelism: 4\nhikari.maximumPoolSize: 20  # parallelism must stay below pool size"}]}, "fix_risk_level": "medium", "matched_runbook_code": "R1"}', 5375, 0, N'1f204bdfaebc643eafac1f0efa58dbaa1e3ad39c8d4eb281acc23f74696aef1d', N'[{"code": "file_path_replaced", "parameters": {"count": 1}}]', NULL, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000384', NULL),
