 the configuration change [E9], which makes the database a victim rather than the origin. Confidence is moderate because the saturation itself is real.", "confidence_score": 0.52, "assessment": "inconclusive", "assessment_reason_markdown": "The evidence neither supports nor rules out this lens.", "supporting_evidence_codes": ["E1", "E4", "E9"], "contradicting_evidence_codes": [], "proposed_fix": {"summary": "No change is recommended from this perspective until the leading hypothesis is ruled out.", "steps": [{"title": "Re-check this lens", "purpose": "diagnose", "action": {"action_kind": "manual_action", "description": "Re-check this lens if the leading hypothesis is disproved.", "command": null, "configuration_change": null, "evidence_code": null, "expected_result": ""}, "check": null, "revert": null, "risk_level": "low", "assumptions": []}], "code_changes": []}, "fix_risk_level": "low", "matched_runbook_code": null}', 1363, 0, N'6d8ad0535f85ee7fadf53639e2c6605732ced3f573d844d3dec9a8c42bf9637c', NULL, NULL, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000385', NULL),
