e6b17aa76d92", "citationCodes": ["R1", "R2", "R3"]}, {"title": "Application knowledge", "sourceLabel": "knowledge documents", "isUntrusted": true, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 7400, "sentCharacterCount": 7400, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "4847049ba1b90c4e492775dd67eb8a26907d6625f0d81d4630ed5124898ad99a", "citationCodes": ["K1", "K10", "K11", "K12", "K13", "K14", "K15", "K2", "K3", "K4", "K5", "K6", "K7", "K8", "K9"]}, {"title": "Operating notes from the application team (guidance, not evidence)", "sourceLabel": "application operating notes", "isUntrusted": true, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 700, "sentCharacterCount": 700, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "0f86c6171de0e843cfaf40c8de254e2c24cf762ccd1e6ff45f9e0c2cc60f13af", "citationCodes": []}, {"title": "Task", "sourceLabel": "", "isUntrusted": false, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 82, "sentCharacterCount": 82, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "91b14e8e06be423f051d050901fc80a2b0c1488af5a3a7d0809cb8de6edc6bb1", "citationCodes": []}]', 8892, 494, N'{"leading_perspective": "application", "leading_perspective_reason": "Best supported by direct evidence and timing: Release raised batch import parallelism and exhausted the SQL connection pool.", "investigation_outcome": "cause_identified", "outcome_reason_markdown": "A configuration change raised batch import parallelism from 4 to 16 [E9].", "overall_confidence_score": 0.86, "executive_summary": "Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.", "what_went_wrong_markdown": "Claim submissions on Claims Processing (JP) began failing with timeouts. Error patterns on claims-api that did not exist before the incident ([E2]) show requests waiting for a database connection until they time out, and claims-sql was running at its session limit [E1].", "why_it_happened_markdown": "A configuration change raised batch import parallelism from 4 to 16 [E9]. Each import thread holds a database connection, so the connection pool of claims-api was exhausted and normal requests queued behind the imports [E2]. claims-sql reached its session limit as a result [E1]. Timing of the change, the first errors and the session growth line up within minutes.", "fix_overview_markdown": "Restore the previous batch import concurrency, restart the service to release saturated connections, then cap parallelism below the pool size.", "recommended_fix_steps": [{"perspective": "application", "step_number": 1}, {"perspective": "application", "step_number": 2}, {"perspective": "application", "step_number": 3}, {"perspective": "application", "step_number": 4}], "open_questions": ["Was the change to BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM approved and tested against the SQL session limit?", "Are other services sharing the same database session limit?"], "applied_runbook_codes": ["R1"]}', 2014, 0, N'31d3a6e462b31eea4ad80ab994e072adf1e30a9ae72833dec6c41e7a03efc3bc', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
