    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000389', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000358', 11, N'communications', N'ai_call', N'succeeded', NULL, '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', 0, N'incident_communications', N'incident_communications', N'3', N'bfc752f8b0acd6784d836526c62604cbbb2f436053263feb5ffb93ec89339b61', N'd18b85457be04f5403890e9547feddda3983b7c256d8604d720cb3a58c408989', N'offline', N'offline-factory', N'fast', N'[{"title": "Application", "sourceLabel": "", "isUntrusted": false, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 64, "sentCharacterCount": 64, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "6f1f957d60afdb336ee76e00cc05da59d3d44759be78a9c982b3e653b5c2c843", "citationCodes": []}, {"title": "Investigation findings", "sourceLabel": "investigation findings", "isUntrusted": true, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 1216, "sentCharacterCount": 1216, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "c2244f616dab8d0cdd5da087333c728637b47bf6e262c4e07b212951379b4cdd", "citationCodes": ["E1", "E2", "E9"]}, {"title": "Requested drafts", "sourceLabel": "", "isUntrusted": false, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 78, "sentCharacterCount": 78, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "393b61ccf3dea1c42b5ddf198241c0ded2d2b7c15a8dfbabceafc2ecd39532c2", "citationCodes": []}, {"title": "Task", "sourceLabel": "", "isUntrusted": false, "isFlagged": false, "characterCount": 55, "sentCharacterCount": 55, "isTruncated": false, "sha256": "dc9412383a5711f7e917ae96158ec8cd9a7dd9448e472eb13947c408210bd370", "citationCodes": []}]', 996, 1132, N'{"drafts": [{"communication_type": "initial_update", "language_code": "en", "subject_line": "[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Initial update", "body_markdown": "We are aware of an issue affecting Claims Processing (JP) (claims-api, claims-sql). Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.\n\n- **Status:** investigating\n- **Next update:** the time of the next update will be confirmed"}, {"communication_type": "initial_update", "language_code": "ja", "subject_line": "【P2】Claims Processing (JP): 初報", "body_markdown": "関係者各位\n\nClaims Processing (JP)で障害を確認しています。影響を受けているサービス: claims-api, claims-sql。\n\n- 影響: 保険金請求の送信が遅延またはエラーになっています。\n- 現状: 調査中。暫定の原因分析では、直前の設定変更でバッチ取込の並列数が4から16に増え、データベース接続プールが枯渇したことが原因の可能性が高いと見ています。(確度 約86%)\n- 次回報告: 時刻は改めてお知らせします\n\n詳細が分かり次第、改めてご連絡します。"}, {"communication_type": "executive_summary", "language_code": "en", "subject_line": "[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Executive summary", "body_markdown": "Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.\n\n- **Status:** recovery in progress\n- **Next update:** the time of the next update will be confirmed"}, {"communication_type": "executive_summary", "language_code": "ja", "subject_line": "【P2】Claims Processing (JP): 経営層向けサマリー", "body_markdown": "Claims Processing (JP)で障害が発生しています。\n\n- 影響: 保険金請求の送信が遅延またはエラーになっています。\n- 想定される原因: 直前の設定変更でバッチ取込の並列数が4から16に増え、データベース接続プールが枯渇したことが原因の可能性が高いと見ています。\n- 対応状況: 復旧作業を進めています。\n- 次回報告: 時刻は改めてお知らせします"}, {"communication_type": "preliminary_report", "language_code": "en", "subject_line": "[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Preliminary report", "body_markdown": "**Impact:** claims-api, claims-sql are affected.\n\n**Likely cause (confidence 86%):** A configuration change raised batch import parallelism from 4 to 16 [E9]. Each import thread holds a database connection, so the connection pool of claims-api was exhausted and normal requests queued behind the imports [E2]. claims-sql reached its session limit as a result [E1]. Timing of the change, the first errors and the session growth line up within minutes.\n\n**Mitigation:** see the proposed fix in the investigation.\n\n**Next update:** the time of the next update will be confirmed"}, {"communication_type": "preliminary_report", "language_code": "ja", "subject_line": "【P2】Claims Processing (JP): 暫定報告", "body_markdown": "関係者各位\n\nClaims Processing (JP)で障害を確認しています。影響を受けているサービス: claims-api, claims-sql。\n\n- 影響: 保険金請求の送信が遅延またはエラーになっています。\n- 現状: 調査中。暫定の原因分析では、直前の設定変更でバッチ取込の並列数が4から16に増え、データベース接続プールが枯渇したことが原因の可能性が高いと見ています。(確度 約86%)\n- 次回報告: 時刻は改めてお知らせします\n\n詳細が分かり次第、改めてご連絡します。"}]}', 3059, 0, N'7110670a0746f730716271a75cc1896b49c8d6bcd5abcba8a2a3c6bccff5b212', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
