## Summary

The benefits portal is slow or unavailable because our vendor is having a service problem in the Asia-Pacific region. We are tracking the vendor''s incident and will update employees when it is resolved.

## Impact

Employee Benefits Portal (SaaS) was degraded for 74 minutes. Employees cannot reliably open the benefits portal of Employee Benefits Portal (SaaS); Keigan''s synthetic probe fails about 40 percent of the time with HTTP 503.

## Timeline

| Time | Event |
| --- | --- |
| 2026-11-11 06:25 UTC | Incident INC004090822 opened in ServiceNow |
| 2026-11-11 06:26 UTC | Keigan started investigating |
| 2026-11-11 06:28 UTC | Evidence collected: 2 items, 0 strong |
| 2026-11-11 06:29 UTC | Root cause analysis ready: cause not visible (confidence 90%) |
| 2026-11-11 06:45 UTC | Responder confirmed the proposed fix was applied |
| 2026-11-11 07:39 UTC | Incident resolved |

## Root cause

The SaaS vendor is experiencing degraded performance in its APAC region, which its status page confirms, and our probes see HTTP 503 and multi-second latency. No MetLife change is involved.

## Contributing factors

- Existing alerts did not describe the failing component clearly enough to shorten diagnosis.
- The relevant limit or dependency was not covered by a capacity or readiness check.

## Detection

The incident was raised in ServiceNow and picked up by Keigan, which started the investigation immediately and collected evidence within minutes.

## Response

Responders followed the investigation''s proposed fix. Total time to restore service: 74 minutes.

## What went well

- Keigan assembled evidence and a ranked root cause hypothesis before responders joined.
- Stakeholders received bilingual updates early.

## What could be improved

- Detection depended on a user-visible symptom; an earlier signal would shorten time to detect.
- The fix steps were manual and should be rehearsed.

## Action items
| Action | Owner role | Due | Type | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Negotiate a vendor SLA with regional failover and incident notification commitments | sre | 2027-01-10 | prevent | top |
| Subscribe operations to the vendor status feed so incidents are known within minutes | sre | 2026-11-18 | detect | normal |
| Prepare a standard employee notice template for vendor outages | sre | 2026-11-25 | mitigate | normal |

## Lessons learned

